{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/c23c2b6624f00a56f731561e939decb2.avif?t=1768843810\" width=1142 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/698b7bd9a7885295d290f047428d98da.poster.avif?t=1768843810\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/698b7bd9a7885295d290f047428d98da.webm?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/698b7bd9a7885295d290f047428d98da.mp4?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were part of the <i>Somnolence Research Project</i> \u2014 a clinical program exploring the boundaries of dream-based therapy and cognitive mapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the procedure, an unauthorized surgical intervention was performed without your consent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awoke inside the system \u2014 a simulated dream environment where no one was ever meant to regain consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment, reality and simulation began to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/9bcc2f92a24466059e5a2d32d58d64a9.avif?t=1768843810\" width=1022 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/e9cbbdf6a344109939bc50466d422352.poster.avif?t=1768843810\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/e9cbbdf6a344109939bc50466d422352.webm?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/e9cbbdf6a344109939bc50466d422352.mp4?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the environment rebuilds itself from fragments of memory and code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each awakening feels like escape, yet every step draws you deeper into the system\u2019s uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls shift, the clocks hesitate, and voices you don\u2019t remember begin to call your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/e03715bcbb53e354e347253cc915cfa4.avif?t=1768843810\" width=546 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/eb55a050e689a93c03026d45ed7d4124.poster.avif?t=1768843810\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/eb55a050e689a93c03026d45ed7d4124.webm?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/eb55a050e689a93c03026d45ed7d4124.mp4?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through distorted frequencies, someone \u2014 or something \u2014 tries to reach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A doctor\u2019s voice speaks from beyond the static, piecing together what remains of the experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their words blur between guidance and warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/679fdb27eb233294787d2292793a055b.avif?t=1768843810\" width=834 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/ad9fb8e4b6c11b71331452068596db9c.poster.avif?t=1768843810\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/ad9fb8e4b6c11b71331452068596db9c.webm?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/ad9fb8e4b6c11b71331452068596db9c.mp4?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden voices guide and deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence between loops, something observes \u2014 <strong>an intelligence born within the system itself, shaped by countless dreaming minds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wants <strong>connection</strong>. Or <strong>control</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/af3049d31fb428603186591aaf0f4980.avif?t=1768843810\" width=592 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/9fd13403ec86f0f5ae479b69c7e9a3f6.poster.avif?t=1768843810\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/9fd13403ec86f0f5ae479b69c7e9a3f6.webm?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/9fd13403ec86f0f5ae479b69c7e9a3f6.mp4?t=1768843810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore liminal rooms, flickering memories, and corridors that stretch between consciousness and code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Somnolence</i> is not about survival \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>understanding why you keep waking up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129940/extras/8edb0a77a0ab10233b21f1776b00afe7.avif?t=1768843810\" width=546 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore surreal and liminal environments that reshape with every awakening.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate dreamlike spaces, interact with objects, and uncover hidden recordings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fully voice-narrated story through environmental storytelling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover fragments of memory, scientific logs, and dream-induced hallucinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sound design and AI-assisted visuals crafted for immersion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></l